	('It has no collar','Nó không đeo vòng cổ','00:00:10.770','00:00:12.930','esl-fast-beginner-1-11'),
	('Kate takes it home','Kate đưa nó về nhà','00:00:13.590','00:00:15.650','esl-fast-beginner-1-11'),
